            "body": "We should consider changing the markup of some of the PatternFly icons, where the icon is used by itself. One very noteworthly place is on the updates link on the host overview. There's a bug icon that stands alone.\r\n\r\nDetails to make icons & emoji more accessible @:\r\n- https://tink.uk/accessible-emoji/\r\n- http://adrianroselli.com/2016/12/accessible-emoji-tweaked.html\r\n- https://codepen.io/aardrian/pen/ENJdjN?editors=1100\r\n\r\nThe simple method in the first link is probably adaquate.\r\n\r\nIt isn't needed when the icon is just reinforcing the text.",
