            "body": "# a11y bug\r\n```\r\nErro: This form field should be labelled in some way. Use the label element (either with a \"for\" attribute or wrapped around the form field), or \"title\", \"aria-label\" or \"aria-labelledby\" attributes as appropriate.                                                                                                   \r\n   \u251c\u2500\u2500 WCAG2AA.Principle1.Guideline1_3.1_3_1.F68\r\n   \u251c\u2500\u2500 #searchModal > div > div > div:nth-child(2) > div > form > div > div:nth-child(1) > input\r\n   \u2514\u2500\u2500 <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Search Platforms, software or administrations\">\r\n```",
